<title>USA: Peoples BancTrust Co sets 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Peoples BancTrust Co sets 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>SELMA, Ala. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peoples BancTrust Co Inc said on Tuesday that it set a two-for-one stock split payable June 15, 1997 to shareholders of record on June 6, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it also has set a quarterly cash dividend payable at a rate of $0.15 a share on the shares before the split. The dividend is unchanged and is payable the same date as the stock split.</p>
<p>Peoples BancTrust had 1,693,694 shares outstanding before the stock split, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
</text>
